                            <comment id="16741285" author="ignitetcbot" created="Sat, 12 Jan 2019 13:24:32 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2775370&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16741287" author="dmitriygovorukhin" created="Sat, 12 Jan 2019 13:31:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The issue was merged with the incorrect comment (as &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10909&quot; title=&quot;GridCacheBalancingStoreSelfTest.testConcurrentLoad flaky test fail in Cache 1&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-10909&quot;&gt;IGNITE-10909&lt;/a&gt;),&#160;0fddf1a8b46482e3d0016b48e2cc9ba4bde026fb&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16764843" author="slava.koptilin" created="Mon, 11 Feb 2019 10:34:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=DmitriyGovorukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;DmitriyGovorukhin&quot;&gt;DmitriyGovorukhin&lt;/a&gt; ,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It seems that the problem is still there.&#160;The root cause of the NPE is that the name of a service, which is returned by &lt;tt&gt;GridServiceDeploymentCompoundFuture#servicesToRollback&lt;/tt&gt;, is &lt;tt&gt;null&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
java.lang.NullPointerException
at java.util.concurrent.ConcurrentHashMap.replaceNode(ConcurrentHashMap.java:1106)
at java.util.concurrent.ConcurrentHashMap.remove(ConcurrentHashMap.java:1097)
at org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.service.GridServiceProcessor.deployAll(GridServiceProcessor.java:646)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve created a new PR in order to address this issue: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/6077&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/6077&lt;/a&gt;&#160;Please take a look at this.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Team City:&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F6077%2Fhead&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F6077%2Fhead&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16765262" author="dmitriygovorukhin" created="Mon, 11 Feb 2019 18:43:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=slava.koptilin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;slava.koptilin&quot;&gt;slava.koptilin&lt;/a&gt; Looks good to me, merged.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
